# Cloudflare Pages redirects

# www -> apex canonicalization. Both hostnames are proxied to this same
# Pages project (DNS confirmed 2026-08-07), so www was serving a live 200
# duplicate of every page instead of consolidating to the canonical apex
# domain used in astro.config.mjs `site:` and every <link rel="canonical">.
# The canonical tag alone told search engines which copy to prefer; this
# 301 stops the duplicate hostname from being crawled/indexed at all.
https://www.neighborhoodhaulingut.com/*  https://neighborhoodhaulingut.com/:splat  301

# Crawlers commonly request /sitemap.xml — Astro generates /sitemap-index.xml
/sitemap.xml                        /sitemap-index.xml                         301
